From: ssch71 <ssch71@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Raise the screen-off Quick Share scan window

Screen-off discovery runs a custom 55/3120 scan (~1.8% duty). On b5q a
GMS screen-off scan lifts the controller to 160/3120, but z3q's QCA
controller gets no GMS screen-off scan, so the 55 window is all there is
and no REQUEST_0x01 from a searching phone is ever received. Use 160.

--- a/smali/o2/o.smali
+++ b/smali/o2/o.smali
@@ -630,7 +630,7 @@
 
     .line 132
     .line 133
-    const/16 p0, 0x37
+    const/16 p0, 0xa0
 
     .line 134
     .line 135
